        "lesson_id": 2501,
        "title": "Problem set 1: Kaplan-Meier by hand",
        "excerpt": "Estimate a survival curve without software.",
        "content": {
          "html": "<p>Use the 12 observations in the handout. Show each step of the product-limit estimator.</p><pre><code class=\"language-r\">library(survival)\nfit &lt;- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ 1, data = ps1)\nsummary(fit)</code></pre>",
          "json": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Use the 12 observations in the handout. Show each step of the product-limit estimator."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "attrs": {
                  "language": "r"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "library(survival)\nfit <- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ 1, data = ps1)\nsummary(fit)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "markdown": "Use the 12 observations in the handout. Show each step of the product-limit estimator.\n\n```r\nlibrary(survival)\nfit <- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ 1, data = ps1)\nsummary(fit)\n```"
